---
import UiPanelShell from '@/components/islands/UiPanelShell.vue';
import UiSectionIntro from '@/components/islands/UiSectionIntro.vue';
---

<section id="overview" class="space-y-6">
  <UiSectionIntro
    eyebrow="Operating model"
    title="Keep orchestration policy in the DAG instead of smearing it across runtime glue"
    description="Dagonizer keeps routing, checkpoints, retries, and visualization attached to the DAG document instead of splitting them across disconnected subsystems."
  />

  <div class="grid gap-5 xl:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
    <UiPanelShell title="What stays explicit" subtitle="Operator view">
      <div class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300">
        <p>Define placements, routes, and terminals as graph data instead of hiding control flow inside callbacks and handlers.</p>
        <p>Use checkpoints, routing, retries, scatter, and fan-in as part of one runtime contract rather than separate subsystems.</p>
        <p>Review the same workflow artifact in docs, visualization, and live execution instead of translating between representations.</p>
      </div>
    </UiPanelShell>

    <slot />
  </div>
</section>
